    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{3\\sqrt5}{5}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac3{\\sqrt5}&=\\frac3{\\sqrt5}\\times\\frac{\\sqrt5}{\\sqrt5}\\\\\\frac3{\\sqrt5}&=\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{5}.\\end{align*}$$",
